+# Alpha50X 5.6 — active crypto PAPER scanning
+
+The crypto scanner checks newly closed one-minute candles independently of
+cross-market history and contract requests. Warm instruments rotate in bounded
+batches; missing histories load in a separate bounded pool through the existing
+provider budgets and backoff. Forming candles never generate entries.
+
+Settings offers Active and Standard crypto scanning. Active is the default;
+the selected mode persists. A counter shows how many different instruments were
+checked in the last minute. Both modes use the existing strategy selection,
+independent model validation, ranked intents and final Risk Guardian checks.
+
+Risk limits, position caps, loss cooldowns, daily fill limits, user pause and kill
+switch remain in force. More scanning does not guarantee a trade or a profit.
+Quote-driven exits remain independent of history loading. Shutdown cannot rearm
+the service. The bounded watchlist scrolling fix remains included.
+
+This is a code-only update for an existing installation. The installer keeps the
+existing ledger, cash balances, positions, credentials, history and manual stops;
+it never replaces them with development fixtures. All trades remain simulated.
